\">Private Hire</a></li>\n                                                        <li class=\"mb-2\"><a href=\"https://www.olympicstudios.com/pages/the-cloakroom-at-selfridges\" class=\"p-0\">The Cloakroom</a></li>\n                                                        <li class=\"mb-2\"><a href=\"https://www.olympicstudios.com/pages/film-membership-signup\" class=\"p-0\">Film Membership</a></li>\n                                                        <li class=\"mb-2\"><a href=\"https://www.thecinemaatselfridges.com/account\" class=\"p-0\">Login</a></li>\n                                                    </ul>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"col-8 col-lg-6 mb-2 pe-lg-7 d-flex justify-content-end\">\n                    <div class=\"menu-promotion\">\n                        <a class=\"menu-promotion__link\" href=\"https://www.olympicstudios.com/pages/the-cinema-at-selfridges\">\n                            <img class=\"menu-promotion__image img-fluid w-100 w-lg-100\" src=\"https://m.cinemacloud.co.uk/imageHeaderFooter/hf_6a3521bcd95cc8.54869616.jpg\" alt=\"\">\n                        </a>\n                        <div class=\"pt-2\">The Cinema at Selfridges / Duke Street</div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n        </div>\n                                    </div>\n\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </nav>\n    <div id=\"page-submenus\" class=\"shopify-section shopify-section-group-header-group section-page-submenus\">\n        <div class=\"d-flex justify-content-evenly\">\n                    <div class=\"submenu\">\n                <a href=\"/whats-on\" class=\"\">\n                    <span class=\"tagline\">What&#039;s On</span>\n                </a>\n            </div>\n                    <div class=\"submenu\">\n                <a href=\"/whats-on/dolby-cinema\" class=\"\">\n                    <span class=\"tagline\">Dolby Cinema</span>\n                </a>\n            </div>\n                    <div class=\"submenu\">\n                <a href=\"/ecards\" class=\"\">\n                    <span class=\"tagline\">Gift Cards</span>\n                </a>\n            </div>\n                    <div class=\"submenu\">\n                <a href=\"/ticket-info\" class=\"\">\n                    <span class=\"tagline\">Ticket Info</span>\n                </a>\n            </div>\n                    <div class=\"submenu\">\n                <a href=\"/boxes\" class=\"\">\n                    <span class=\"tagline\">Boxes</span>\n                </a>\n            </div>\n                </div>\n    </div>\n    \n</section>\n<style>\n    .cc-account-dropdown .cc-account-menu { display:none; }\n    .cc-account-dropdown:hover .cc-account-menu { display:block; }\n    .cc-account-menu-item { font-size:.8rem; color:#212529; text-decoration:none !important; display:block; }\n    .cc-account-menu-item:hover, .cc-account-menu-item:focus { background-color:#f8f9fa; color:#212529; text-decoration:none !important; }\n</style>\n<script>\ndocument.querySelectorAll('.cc-nav-signout').forEach(function(btn) {\n    btn.addEventListener('click', function() {\n        fetch('/api/account/logout', {\n            method: 'POST',\n            headers: { 'Content-Type': 'application/json' },\n            body: JSON.stringify({ action: 'logout' })\n        })\n        .then(function(r) { return r.ok ? r.json() : null; })\n        .then(function() { window.location.href = '/'; })\n        .catch(function() { window.location.reload(); });\n    });\n});\n</script>\n        <div class=\"cc-banner\" style=\"background:#937251\"><div class=\"cc-banner-desktop d-none d-md-block\"><div class=\"container\"><div class=\"d-flex flex-column align-items-center justify-content-center text-center py-2\"><span class=\"cc-banner-title fjalla-one-regular majortitle text-uppercase\" style=\"color:#ffffff;font-size:14px;letter-spacing:0.05em\">FAMILY FILM SEASON</span><span class=\"cc-banner-tagline\" style=\"color:#ffffff;font-size:11px\">£10 cinema tickets for all children under 14</span></div></div></div><div class=\"cc-banner-mobile d-block d-md-none\"><div class=\"container text-center py-2\"><div class=\"cc-banner-tagline\" style=\"color:#ffffff;font-size:11px\">£10 cinema tickets for all children under 14</div></div></div></div><section id=\"section_2_stack\" class=\"bg-dark p-0 m-0\">        <!-- Page Video Modal -->\n        <div id=\"videoModal\" class=\"modal fade\" data-bs-backdrop=\"static\" data-bs-keyboard=\"false\" tabindex=\"-1\" aria-labelledby=\"videoModalLabel\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n            <div class=\"modal-dialog modal-dialog-centered modal-lg\">\n                <div class=\"modal-content\">\n                    <div class=\"modal-header justify-content-center position-relative\">\n                        <div class=\"w-100 text-center\">\n                            <h1 class=\"modal-title fs-5\" id=\"modalTrailerLabel\">Minions &amp; Monsters</h1>\n                        </div>\n                        <button type=\"button\" class=\"btn-close\" data-bs-dismiss=\"modal\" aria-label=\"Close\"></button>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"modal-body p-1 p-md-2\">\n                        <div class=\"ratio ratio-16x9\">\n                            <iframe class=\"embed-responsive-item\" allowfullscreen allow=\"autoplay\" allowfullscreen=\"true\"></iframe>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n        <!-- End Page Video Modal -->\n\n            <div class=\"page-header py-5 py-md-0 ratio ratio-2x1 position-relative\">\n        <picture>\n            <source srcset=\"https://m.cinemacloud.co.uk/imageFilm/2395_7_1.jpg\" media=\"(max-width: 767.9px)\">\n            <source srcset=\"https://m.cinemacloud.co.uk/imageFilm/2395_10_1.jpg\" media=\"(min-width: 768px)\">\n            <img src=\"https://m.cinemacloud.co.uk/imageFilm/2395_10_1.jpg\" alt=\"Background\" class=\"film-header-bg w-100 h-100 position-absolute top-0 start-0 object-fit-cover\" onload=\"this.style.opacity=1;\">\n        </picture>\n        <div class=\"position-absolute w-100 w-md-50 h-50 h-md-100 bg-grad-dark\"></div>\n        <div id=\"movie-overlay\" class=\"d-flex flex-column justify-content-end justify-content-md-center align-items-center align-items-md-start h-100 mx-md-5 mx-lg-7\">\n            \n            \n            <img class=\"title-treatment mb-4 mb-md-6 my-3\" src=\"https://m.cinemacloud.co.uk/imageFilm/2395_8_1.png\" alt=\"Minions &amp; Monsters\" onerror=\"this.style.display='none';this.nextElementSibling.style.display=''\"><div class=\"title-treatment mb-4 mb-md-6 text-white text-left\" style=\"display:none;\"><h1 class=\"h4 text-white fw-semibold\">Minions &amp; Monsters</h1></div>\n            \n            <div class=\"movie-badges mb-2 d-flex justify-content-start\">\n                <span class=\"badge text-bg-secondary me-2 px-3 fw-semibold\">2026</span><span class=\"badge text-bg-secondary me-2 px-3 fw-semibold\">1hr 30mins</span><img src=\"https://m.cinemacloud.co.uk/imageMisc/Dolby/Cinema/Vertical/DLB_Cin_vert_rgb_wht_@1x.png\" class=\"cert-20 me-2\" alt=\"Movie Sound Dolby Cinema\">\n<img src=\"https://m.cinemacloud.co.uk/imageMisc/Dolby/Atmos/Vertical/DLB_Atms_vert_rgb_wht_@1x.png\" class=\"cert-20 me-2\" alt=\"Movie Sound Dolby Atmos\"><img src=\"https://m.cinemacloud.co.uk/bbfc/SVGs/BBFC_U_RGB.svg\" class=\"cert-20\" alt=\"BBFC Cert U\">\n            </div>\n            \n            <p class=\"text-light fs-6 fw-semibold\"><small>Adventure, Animation, Comedy, Family, Fantasy</small></p>\n                        <div id=\"trailer-button\" class=\"d-none d-md-block me-md-auto mb-3\">\n                <a href=\"#\" class=\"btn btn-md rounded-pill d-inline-flex align-items-center blurred-button\"\n                   data-bs-toggle=\"modal\" data-bs-target=\"#videoModal\"\n                   data-video=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/ZSdOwt-G49w?autoplay=1&origin=\">\n                    <i class=\"bi bi-play-fill fs-5 me-2\"></i>\n                    <span class=\"fs-6\">Trailer</span>\n                </a>\n            </div>\n            <script>\n                document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', function() {\n                    const videoModal = document.getElementById('videoModal');\n                    const modalIframe = videoModal.querySelector('iframe');\n                    videoModal.addEventListener('show.bs.modal', function(event) {\n                        const button = event.relatedTarget;\n                        const url = button.getAttribute('data-video');\n                        modalIframe.setAttribute('src', url);\n                        modalIframe.setAttribute('allow', 'accelerometer; autoplay; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture');\n                    });\n                    videoModal.addEventListener('hidden.bs.modal', function() {\n                        modalIframe.removeAttribute('src');\n                        modalIframe.removeAttribute('allow');\n                    });\n                });\n            </script>\n            \n        </div>\n    </div></section><section id=\"section_3_stack\" class=\"bg-white p-0 m-0\">        <div class=\"container my-5\">\n            <div class=\"row\">\n                <!-- Left column: film info -->\n                <div class=\"col-12 col-lg-6 order-1 order-lg-0\">\n                    <h3 class=\"fjalla-one-regular fs-3 text-uppercase text-dark mb-4\">Minions & Monsters</h3>\n                    <div class=\"d-flex mt-1 mb-4\"><img class=\"flex-shrink-1 cert-40\" src=\"https://m.cinemacloud.co.uk/bbfc/SVGs/BBFC_U_RGB.svg\" alt=\"BBFC Cert\"><small style=\"font-size: 0.7rem;\" class=\"w-100 small ps-2 text-muted fst-italic\">Admission to film screenings is strictly in accordance with BBFC age ratings and valid proof of age may be required as a condition of entry.</small></div>                    <div id=\"trailer-button\" class=\"d-block d-md-none me-md-auto mt-0 mb-4\"><a href=\"#\" class=\"btn btn-white btn-sm btn-lg-md rounded-1\" data-bs-toggle=\"modal\" data-bs-target=\"#videoModal\" data-video=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/ZSdOwt-G49w?autoplay=1\">Watch Trailer</a></div>                    <h3 class=\"fjalla-one-regular fs-4 text-dark mb-4\">Synopsis</h3><div class=\"mb-5 text-dark\">This is the rambunctious, ridiculous and totally true story of how the Minions conquered Hollywood, became movie stars, lost everything, unleashed monsters onto the world and then banded together to try and save the planet from the mayhem they had just created.</div>                                                            <div class=\"row\">\n                        <div class=\"col-7 col-md-8\">\n                                                                                    <p class=\"mb-1 fw-semibold text-secondary\">Duration:</p><p class=\"mt-0 fw-bolder\">1hr 30mins</p>                            <p class=\"mb-1 fw-semibold text-secondary\">Available Sound Formats:</p><p class=\"mt-0 fw-bolder sound-formats\">Dolby Cinema, Dolby Atmos</p>                            <p class=\"mb-1 fw-semibold text-secondary\">Genre:</p><p class=\"mt-0 fw-bolder\">Adventure, Animation, Comedy, Family, Fantasy</p>                            <p class=\"mb-1 fw-semibold text-secondary\">Country:</p><p class=\"mt-0 fw-bolder\">United States</p>                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"col-5 col-md-4\">\n                            <p class=\"mb-1 fw-semibold text-secondary\">Director:</p><p class=\"mt-0 fw-bolder\">Pierre Coffin</p>                            <p class=\"mb-1 fw-semibold text-secondary\">Starring:</p><p class=\"mt-0 fw-bolder\">Pierre Coffin,<br> Jeff Bridges,<br> Christoph Waltz,<br> Allison Janney,<br> Phil LaMarr,<br> Bobby Moynihan,<br> Jesse Eisenberg,<br> Zoey Deutch,<br> Trey Parker</p>                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                                                            <hr class=\"dark horizontal my-5\">                </div>\n\n                <!-- Right column: sticky showtime panel -->\n                <div class=\"col-12 col-lg-6 ps-lg-5 order-0 order-lg-1\">\n                    <div class=\"d-none d-md-block position-sticky\" style=\"top: 164px\">\n                        <h2 class=\"fs-4 fjalla-one-regular text-dark\">Show Times</h2><p class=\"fs-6\">To book online, please select a time from below:</p><p class=\"mb-4\">First select a cinema location from below and then select the time:</p>                <div id=\"location-buttons\" class=\"row row-cols-2 g-2 mb-4\">\n                                        <div class=\"col\">\n                        <a role=\"button\" data-subsite=\"6\" class=\"select-subsite text-decoration-none\">\n                            <div class=\"card h-100 bg-power\">\n                                <img src=\"/assets/images/ps-inside.jpg\" class=\"card-img-top image-highlight\" alt=\"...\">\n                                <div class=\"card-footer text-center p-2 pb-0\">\n                                    <p class=\"d-none d-lg-block text-white text-spacing-2 text-uppercase homepage-small mb-2\">The Cinema in The Power Station</p>\n                                    <p class=\"d-block d-lg-none text-white text-spacing-2 text-uppercase homepage-small mb-2\">The Cinema in The Power Station</p>\n                                </div>\n                            </div>\n                        </a>\n                        <style>.image-highlight:hover{filter:brightness(1.3);transition:filter 0.3s ease}.image-highlight{transition:filter 0.3s ease}</style>\n                    </div>\n                                                            <div class=\"col\">\n                        <a role=\"button\" data-subsite=\"7\" class=\"select-subsite text-decoration-none\">\n                            <div class=\"card h-100 bg-arches\">\n                                <img src=\"/assets/images/ps-outside.jpg\" class=\"card-img-top image-highlight\" alt=\"...\">\n                                <div class=\"card-footer text-center p-2 pb-0\">\n                                    <p class=\"d-none d-lg-block text-white text-spacing-2 text-uppercase homepage-small mb-2\">The Cinema in The Arches</p>\n                                    <p class=\"d-block d-lg-none text-white text-spacing-2 text-uppercase homepage-small mb-2\">The Cinema in The Arches</p>\n                                </div>\n                            </div>\n                        </a>\n                    </div>\n                                    </div>\n                <script>\n                    document.addEventListener(\"DOMContentLoaded\", function () {\n                        var buttons = document.querySelectorAll(\".select-subsite\");\n                        var showtimes6 = document.getElementById(\"showtimes6d\");\n                        var showtimes7 = document.getElementById(\"showtimes7d\");\n                        buttons.forEach(function(button) {\n                            button.addEventListener(\"click\", function () {\n                                var subsite = this.getAttribute(\"data-subsite\");\n                                if (subsite === \"6\") {\n                                    showtimes6.classList.remove(\"d-none\");\n                                    showtimes6.classList.add(\"d-block\");\n                                    showtimes7.classList.remove(\"d-block\");\n                                    showtimes7.classList.add(\"d-none\");\n                                } else if (subsite === \"7\") {\n                                    showtimes7.classList.remove(\"d-none\");\n                                    showtimes7.classList.add(\"d-block\");\n                                    showtimes6.classList.remove(\"d-block\");\n                                    showtimes6.classList.add(\"d-none\");\n                                }\n                                fetch(\"/api/session/select-subsite\", {\n                                    method: \"POST\",\n                                    headers: {\n                                        \"X-Requested-With\": \"XMLHttpRequest\",\n                                        \"Content-Type\": \"application/x-www-form-urlencoded\"\n                                    },\n                                    body: \"subsite=\" + encodeURIComponent(subsite)\n                                })\n                                .then(function(r) { return r.json(); })\n                                .then(function(data) { if (!data.success) { console.error(\"Error:\", data.message); } })\n                                .catch(function(err) { console.error(\"Request failed:\", err); });\n                            });\n                        });\n                    });\n                </script>\n                <div id=\"showtimes6d\" class=\"d-none\"><h3>Show times in The Power Station</h3><p>These screenings are located on 3rd Floor, Turbine Hall B, Battersea Power Station.</p>        <script>\n            document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', function() {\n                var tooltipTriggerList = [].slice.call(document.querySelectorAll('[data-bs-toggle=\"tooltip\"]'));\n                tooltipTriggerList.map(function(el) { return new bootstrap.Tooltip(el); });\n                document.querySelectorAll('a.disabled').forEach(function(el) {\n                    el.addEventListener('click', function(e) { e.preventDefault(); });\n                });\n            });\n        </script>\n                    <h4 class=\"fs-6 mb-4 fw-semibold text-muted\">Today - Saturday, July 11</h4>\n            <div class=\"d-flex flex-wrap text-center mb-4\">\n             