title fs-4 hm-h text-uppercase p-0 m-0 pb-2\">UNRIVALLED CINEMA</h2><div class=\" pb-2\">Cinema as it’s meant to be - immersive, effortless, and unforgettable. Our screens offer a truly unrivalled experience with state-of-the-art sound and vision. Settle into spacious, reclining seats with ample legroom and personal tables. The Grab & Go bar offers quiet snacks, and curated wines and drinks to enjoy throughout the film.</div></div></div></div></div></div></div></section><footer class=\"container-fluid bg-light mt-auto\">\n    <div class=\"p-1 pt-4 p-lg-5 border-top row\">\n\n        <div class=\"col-12 col-lg-3 mb-5 mb-lg-3\">\n            <h6 class=\"fjalla-one-regular text-dark mb-4 text-uppercase lh-sm\">A hub of entertainment, with cinema at its heart, set in iconic locations</h6>\n            <div class=\"flex-column text-body-secondary\">\n                <p>Cinema as it&#039;s meant to be - immersive, effortless, and unforgettable. With state-of-the-art sound and vision, our screens offer a truly unrivalled experience. Settle into spacious, reclining seats with ample legroom and personal tables. The Grab &amp; Go bar offers quiet snacks, and curated wines and drinks to enjoy throughout the film.</p>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"col-12 col-lg-6 row d-flex justify-content-start justify-content-lg-center\">\n            <div class=\"col-12 col-md-4 mb-5 mb-lg-3 d-flex justify-content-start justify-content-lg-center\">\n                <div class=\"text-sm-start\">\n                    <h6 class=\"fjalla-one-regular text-dark text-uppercase mb-4\">Discover</h6>\n                    <ul class=\"nav flex-column\">\n                                                <li class=\"\"><p class=\"mb-2\"><a href=\"https://www.olympicstudios.com/pages/select-your-cinema\" class=\"p-0\">Locations</a></p></li>\n                                                <li class=\"\"><p class=\"mb-2\"><a href=\"/ecards\" class=\"p-0\">Gift Cards</a></p></li>