agline\" style=\"color:#ffffff;font-size:11px\">£10 cinema tickets for all children under 14</span></div></div></div><div class=\"cc-banner-mobile d-block d-md-none\"><div class=\"container text-center py-2\"><div class=\"cc-banner-tagline\" style=\"color:#ffffff;font-size:11px\">£10 cinema tickets for all children under 14</div></div></div></div><section id=\"section_2_stack\" class=\"bg-dark p-0 m-0\">        <!-- Page Video Modal -->\n        <div id=\"videoModal\" class=\"modal fade\" data-bs-backdrop=\"static\" data-bs-keyboard=\"false\" tabindex=\"-1\" aria-labelledby=\"videoModalLabel\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n            <div class=\"modal-dialog modal-dialog-centered modal-lg\">\n                <div class=\"modal-content\">\n                    <div class=\"modal-header justify-content-center position-relative\">\n                        <div class=\"w-100 text-center\">\n                            <h1 class=\"modal-title fs-5\" id=\"modalTrailerLabel\">Michael</h1>\n                        </div>\n                        <button type=\"button\" class=\"btn-close\" data-bs-dismiss=\"modal\" aria-label=\"Close\"></button>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"modal-body p-1 p-md-2\">\n                        <div class=\"ratio ratio-16x9\">\n                            <iframe class=\"embed-responsive-item\" allowfullscreen allow=\"autoplay\" allowfullscreen=\"true\"></iframe>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n        <!-- End Page Video Modal -->\n\n            <div class=\"page-header py-5 py-md-0 ratio ratio-2x1 position-relative\">\n        <picture>\n            <source srcset=\"https://m.cinemacloud.co.uk/imageFilm/2343_7_1.jpg\" media=\"(max-width: 767.9px)\">\n            <source srcset=\"https://m.cinemacloud.co.uk/imageFilm/2343_10_1.jpg\" media=\"(min-width: 768px)\">\n            <img src=\"https://m.cinemacloud.co.uk/imageFilm/2343_10_1.jpg\" alt=\"Background\" class=\"film-header-bg w-100 h-100 position-absolute top-0 start-0 object-fit-cover\" onload=\"this.style.opacity=1;\">\n        </picture>\n        <div class=\"position-absolute w-100 w-md-50 h-50 h-md-100 bg-grad-dark\"></div>\n        <div id=\"movie-overlay\" class=\"d-flex flex-column justify-content-end justify-content-md-center align-items-center align-items-md-start h-100 mx-md-5 mx-lg-7\">\n            \n            \n            <img class=\"title-treatment mb-4 mb-md-6 my-3\" src=\"https://m.cinemacloud.co.uk/imageFilm/2343_8_1.png\" alt=\"Michael\" onerror=\"this.style.display='none';this.nextElementSibling.style.display=''\"><div class=\"title-treatment mb-4 mb-md-6 text-white text-left\" style=\"display:none;\"><h1 class=\"h4 text-white fw-semibold\">Michael</h1></div>\n            \n            <div class=\"movie-badges mb-2 d-flex justify-content-start\">\n                <span class=\"badge text-bg-secondary me-2 px-3 fw-semibold\">2026</span><span class=\"badge text-bg-secondary me-2 px-3 fw-semibold\">2hr 7mins</span><img src=\"https://m.cinemacloud.co.uk/imageMisc/Dolby/Atmos/Vertical/DLB_Atms_vert_rgb_wht_@1x.png\" class=\"cert-20 me-2\" alt=\"Movie Sound Dolby Atmos\"><img src=\"https://m.cinemacloud.co.uk/bbfc/SVGs/BBFC_12A_RGB.svg\" class=\"cert-20\" alt=\"BBFC Cert 12A\">\n            </div>\n            \n            <p class=\"text-light fs-6 fw-semibold\"><small>Music, Drama</small></p>\n                        <div id=\"trailer-button\" class=\"d-none d-md-block me-md-auto mb-3\">\n                <a href=\"#\" class=\"btn btn-md rounded-pill d-inline-flex align-items-center blurred-button\"\n                   data-bs-toggle=\"modal\" data-bs-target=\"#videoModal\"\n                   data-video=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/3zOLzsbOleM?autoplay=1&origin=\">\n                    <i class=\"bi bi-play-fill fs-5 me-2\"></i>\n                    <span class=\"fs-6\">Trailer</span>\n                </a>\n            </div>\n            <script>\n                document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', function() {\n                    const videoModal = document.getElementById('videoModal');\n                    const modalIframe = videoModal.querySelector('iframe');\n                    videoModal.addEventListener('show.bs.modal', function(event) {\n                        const button = event.relatedTarget;\n                        const url = button.getAttribute('data-video');\n                        modalIframe.setAttribute('src', url);\n                        modalIframe.setAttribute('allow', 'accelerometer; autoplay; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture');\n                    });\n                    videoModal.addEventListener('hidden.bs.modal', function() {\n                        modalIframe.removeAttribute('src');\n                        modalIframe.removeAttribute('allow');\n                    });\n                });\n            </script>\n            \n        </div>\n    </div></section><section id=\"section_3_stack\" class=\"bg-white p-0 m-0\">        <div class=\"container my-5\">\n            <div class=\"row\">\n                <!-- Left column: film info -->\n                <div class=\"col-12 col-lg-6 order-1 order-lg-0\">\n                    <h3 class=\"fjalla-one-regular fs-3 text-uppercase text-dark mb-4\">Michael</h3>\n                    <div class=\"d-flex mt-1 mb-4\"><img class=\"flex-shrink-1 cert-40\" src=\"https://m.cinemacloud.co.uk/bbfc/SVGs/BBFC_12A_RGB.svg\" alt=\"BBFC Cert\"><small style=\"font-size: 0.7rem;\" class=\"w-100 small ps-2 text-muted fst-italic\">Admission to film screenings is strictly in accordance with BBFC age ratings and valid proof of age may be required as a condition of entry.</small></div>                    <div id=\"trailer-button\" class=\"d-block d-md-none me-md-auto mt-0 mb-4\"><a href=\"#\" class=\"btn btn-white btn-sm btn-lg-md rounded-1\" data-bs-toggle=\"modal\" data-bs-target=\"#videoModal\" data-video=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/3zOLzsbOleM?autoplay=1\">Watch Trailer</a></div>                    <h3 class=\"fjalla-one-regular fs-4 text-dark mb-4\">Synopsis</h3><div class=\"mb-5 text-dark\"><p>Michael is the cinematic portrayal of the life and legacy of one of the most influential artists the world has ever known.</p> <p>The film tells the story of Michael Jackson’s life beyond the music, tracing his journey from the discovery of his extraordinary talent as the lead of the Jackson Five, to the visionary artist whose creative ambition fuelled a relentless pursuit to become the biggest entertainer in the world.</p> <p>Highlighting both his life off-stage and some of the most iconic performances from his early solo career, the film gives audiences a front-row seat to Michael Jackson as never before. This is where his story begins.</p></div>                                                            <div class=\"row\">\n                        <div class=\"col-7 col-md-8\">\n                                                                                    <p class=\"mb-1 fw-semibold text-secondary\">Duration:</p><p class=\"mt-0 fw-bolder\">2hr 7mins</p>                            <p class=\"mb-1 fw-semibold text-secondary\">Available Sound Formats:</p><p class=\"mt-0 fw-bolder sound-formats\">Dolby Atmos</p>                            <p class=\"mb-1 fw-semibold text-secondary\">Genre:</p><p class=\"mt-0 fw-bolder\">Music, Drama</p>                            <p class=\"mb-1 fw-semibold text-secondary\">Country:</p><p class=\"mt-0 fw-bolder\">United Kingdom, United States</p>                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"col-5 col-md-4\">\n                            <p class=\"mb-1 fw-semibold text-secondary\">Director:</p><p class=\"mt-0 fw-bolder\">Antoine Fuqua</p>                            <p class=\"mb-1 fw-semibold text-secondary\">Starring:</p><p class=\"mt-0 fw-bolder\">Miles Teller,<br> Nia Long,<br> Colman Domingo,<br> Jaafar Jackson</p>                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                                                            <hr class=\"dark horizontal my-5\">                </div>\n\n                <!-- Right column: sticky showtime panel -->\n                <div class=\"col-12 col-lg-6 ps-lg-5 order-0 order-lg-1\">\n                    <div class=\"d-none d-md-block position-sticky\" style=\"top: 164px\">\n                        <h2 class=\"fs-4 fjalla-one-regular text-dark\">Show Times</h2><p class=\"fs-6\">To book online, please select a time from below:</p><div id=\"showtimes7d\" class=\"d-block\"><h3>Show times in The Arches</h3><p>The following screenings are situated just outside The Power Station, in the Arches under Grosvenor Bridge.</p>        <script>\n            document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', function() {\n                var tooltipTriggerList = [].slice.call(document.querySelectorAll('[data-bs-toggle=\"tooltip\"]'));\n                tooltipTriggerList.map(function(el) { return new bootstrap.Tooltip(el); });\n                document.querySelectorAll('a.disabled').forEach(function(el) {\n                    el.addEventListener('click', function(e) { e.preventDefault(); });\n                });\n            });\n        </script>\n                    <h4 class=\"fs-6 mb-4 fw-semibold text-muted\">Today - Saturday, July 11</h4>\n            <div class=\"d-flex flex-wrap text-center mb-4\">\n                            </div>\n                        <h4 class=\"fs-6 mb-4 fw-semibold text-muted\">Tomorrow - Sunday, July 12</h4>\n            <div class=\"d-flex flex-wrap text-center mb-4\">\n                                    <a role=\"button\"\n                       class=\"btn btn-arches rounded-1 mb-3 me-3 py-1 py-md-3 px-3 d-flex align-items-center\"\n                                              href=\"https://web2.empire.mycloudcinema.com/#/book/58270\"                        style=\"min-height: 40px;\"