\"color:#ffffff;font-size:11px\">£10 cinema tickets for all children under 14</span></div></div></div><div class=\"cc-banner-mobile d-block d-md-none\"><div class=\"container text-center py-2\"><div class=\"cc-banner-tagline\" style=\"color:#ffffff;font-size:11px\">£10 cinema tickets for all children under 14</div></div></div></div><section id=\"section_2_stack\" class=\"bg-dark p-0 m-0\">        <!-- Page Video Modal -->\n        <div id=\"videoModal\" class=\"modal fade\" data-bs-backdrop=\"static\" data-bs-keyboard=\"false\" tabindex=\"-1\" aria-labelledby=\"videoModalLabel\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n            <div class=\"modal-dialog modal-dialog-centered modal-lg\">\n                <div class=\"modal-content\">\n                    <div class=\"modal-header justify-content-center position-relative\">\n                        <div class=\"w-100 text-center\">\n                            <h1 class=\"modal-title fs-5\" id=\"modalTrailerLabel\">Lomu London Premiere + Director Q&amp;A</h1>\n                        </div>\n                        <button type=\"button\" class=\"btn-close\" data-bs-dismiss=\"modal\" aria-label=\"Close\"></button>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"modal-body p-1 p-md-2\">\n                        <div class=\"ratio ratio-16x9\">\n                            <iframe class=\"embed-responsive-item\" allowfullscreen allow=\"autoplay\" allowfullscreen=\"true\"></iframe>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n        <!-- End Page Video Modal -->\n\n            <div class=\"page-header py-5 py-md-0 ratio ratio-2x1 position-relative\">\n        <picture>\n            <source srcset=\"https://m.cinemacloud.co.uk/imageFilm/2436_7_1.jpg\" media=\"(max-width: 767.9px)\">\n            <source srcset=\"https://m.cinemacloud.co.uk/imageFilm/2436_10_1.jpg\" media=\"(min-width: 768px)\">\n            <img src=\"https://m.cinemacloud.co.uk/imageFilm/2436_10_1.jpg\" alt=\"Background\" class=\"film-header-bg w-100 h-100 position-absolute top-0 start-0 object-fit-cover\" onload=\"this.style.opacity=1;\">\n        </picture>\n        <div class=\"position-absolute w-100 w-md-50 h-50 h-md-100 bg-grad-light\"></div>\n        <div id=\"movie-overlay\" class=\"d-flex flex-column justify-content-end justify-content-md-center align-items-center align-items-md-start h-100 mx-md-5 mx-lg-7\">\n            \n            \n            <img class=\"title-treatment mb-4 mb-md-6 my-3\" src=\"https://m.cinemacloud.co.uk/imageFilm/2436_8_1.png\" alt=\"Lomu London Premiere + Director Q&amp;A\" onerror=\"this.style.display='none';this.nextElementSibling.style.display=''\"><div class=\"title-treatment mb-4 mb-md-6 text-white text-left\" style=\"display:none;\"><h1 class=\"h4 text-white fw-semibold\">Lomu London Premiere + Director Q&amp;A</h1></div>\n            \n            <div class=\"movie-badges mb-2 d-flex justify-content-start\">\n                <span class=\"badge text-bg-secondary me-2 px-3 fw-semibold\">2026</span><span class=\"badge text-bg-secondary me-2 px-3 fw-semibold\">1hr 47mins</span><img src=\"https://m.cinemacloud.co.uk/bbfc/SVGs/BBFC_tba_RGB.svg\" class=\"cert-20\" alt=\"BBFC Cert tba\">\n            </div>\n            \n            <p class=\"text-dark fs-6 fw-semibold\"><small>Documentary</small></p>\n            \n        </div>\n    </div></section><section id=\"section_3_stack\" class=\"bg-white p-0 m-0\">        <div class=\"container my-5\">\n            <div class=\"row\">\n                <!-- Left column: film info -->\n                <div class=\"col-12 col-lg-6 order-1 order-lg-0\">\n                    <h3 class=\"fjalla-one-regular fs-3 text-uppercase text-dark mb-4\">Lomu London Premiere + Director Q&A</h3>\n                    <div class=\"d-flex mt-1 mb-4\"><img class=\"flex-shrink-1 cert-40\" src=\"https://m.cinemacloud.co.uk/bbfc/SVGs/BBFC_tba_RGB.svg\" alt=\"BBFC Cert\"><small style=\"font-size: 0.7rem;\" class=\"w-100 small ps-2 text-muted fst-italic\">Admission to film screenings is strictly in accordance with BBFC age ratings and valid proof of age may be required as a condition of entry.</small></div>                                        <h3 class=\"fjalla-one-regular fs-4 text-dark mb-4\">Synopsis</h3><div class=\"mb-5 text-dark\">A Tongan/Kiwi warrior who could run 100 metres in under 11 seconds. He was the youngest All Black to put on the jersey and still holds the record for the most tries scored in World Cup history.</div>                                        <h3 class=\"fjalla-one-regular fs-4 text-dark mb-4\">Info</h3><div class=\"mb-5 text-dark\"><p>London Breeze is thrilled to be partnering with Dogwoof and The Cinema in the Power Station for the London premiere of LOMU - an intimate and heartfelt portrait of Jonah Lomu, the most adored son of the Pacific, a legendary All Black, who transcended the game with his immense power and unstoppable determination.</p><p>From the streets of South Auckland to the world’s biggest rugby stages, this brand new feature documentary traces the extraordinary rise, global impact and private struggles of Jonah Lomu - a Tongan New Zealander who transformed rugby forever, while carrying the weight of culture, faith and expectation few ever truly saw. Through intimate interviews with family and coaches, alongside archival footage of Jonah himself - including never-before-seen family video - the film reveals the personal cost of meteoric success.</p><p>Join us and special guests for this preview screening and meet co-director of the film, Gavin FitzGerald, in the Q&A. As ever with a London Breeze screening, there will be lots of extra goodies and surprises in store. Don’t miss this special event!</p></div>                    <div class=\"row\">\n                        <div class=\"col-7 col-md-8\">\n                                                                                    <p class=\"mb-1 fw-semibold text-secondary\">Duration:</p><p class=\"mt-0 fw-bolder\">1hr 47mins</p>                            <p class=\"mb-1 fw-semibold text-secondary\">Available Sound Formats:</p><p class=\"mt-0 fw-bolder sound-formats\">5.1</p>                            <p class=\"mb-1 fw-semibold text-secondary\">Genre:</p><p class=\"mt-0 fw-bolder\">Documentary</p>                            <p class=\"mb-1 fw-semibold text-secondary\">Country:</p><p class=\"mt-0 fw-bolder\">New Zealand, United Kingdom</p>                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"col-5 col-md-4\">\n                            <p class=\"mb-1 fw-semibold text-secondary\">Director:</p><p class=\"mt-0 fw-bolder\">Gavin FitzGerald,<br> Vea Mafile&#039;o</p>                                                    </div>\n                    </div>\n                                                            <hr class=\"dark horizontal my-5\">                </div>\n\n                <!-- Right column: sticky showtime panel -->\n                <div class=\"col-12 col-lg-6 ps-lg-5 order-0 order-lg-1\">\n                    <div class=\"d-none d-md-block position-sticky\" style=\"top: 164px\">\n                        <h2 class=\"fs-4 fjalla-one-regular text-dark\">Show Times</h2><p class=\"fs-6\">To book online, please select a time from below:</p><div id=\"showtimes6d\" class=\"d-block\"><h3>Show times in The Power Station</h3><p>These screenings are located on 3rd Floor, Turbine Hall B, Battersea Power Station.</p>        <script>\n            document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', function() {\n                var tooltipTriggerList = [].slice.call(document.querySelectorAll('[data-bs-toggle=\"tooltip\"]'));\n                tooltipTriggerList.map(function(el) { return new bootstrap.Tooltip(el); });\n                document.querySelectorAll('a.disabled').forEach(function(el) {\n                    el.addEventListener('click', function(e) { e.preventDefault(); });\n              